/P 39 0 R
/T (As the world marks Earth Day 2026, conversations around climate action must move beyond awareness to practical solutions that improve everyday lives. In Ghana, many households and small businesses continue to face challenges with energy access, particularly in terms of cost and reliability.)
/E (As the world marks Earth Day 2026, conversations around climate action must move beyond awareness to practical solutions that improve everyday lives. In Ghana, many households and small businesses continue to face challenges with energy access, particularly in terms of cost and reliability.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
61 0 obj
