/P 39 0 R
/T (This brief presents insights from a rapid survey on energy use and clean energy adoption. The findings show a strong reliance on the national grid, widespread concerns about electricity costs and reliability, and a clear willingness among respondents to adopt clean energy solutions such as solar.)
/E (This brief presents insights from a rapid survey on energy use and clean energy adoption. The findings show a strong reliance on the national grid, widespread concerns about electricity costs and reliability, and a clear willingness among respondents to adopt clean energy solutions such as solar.)
/Pg 10 0 R
