/T (     Cost and Outages as Dual Burdens)
/E (     Cost and Outages as Dual Burdens)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
91 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 40 0 R
/E (Cost emerged as the most pressing issue across responses. A majority of participants identified high electricity expenses as their main challenge, while others pointed to frequent power outages. Together, these concerns highlight the dual burden of affordability and reliability, which continues to affect both households and small-scale economic activities.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
92 0 obj
<<
